  "schema:name": "Yemen: Population Estimates",
  "schema:description": "This dataset includes population estimates for Yemen for the years 2019, 2021, 2023, and 2024. These estimates are sourced from the Central Statistics Organization (CSO) and extend up to 2025. The information is valuable for researchers and analysts studying Yemen's population trends and for humanitarian planning purposes.",
