      "schema:name": "yem_population_projection_2025_Final.xlsx",
      "schema:description": "The Excel file contains population estimates for 2024. The projections are based on 2004 Census data. The population figures are disaggregated by governorate and district levels, both containing p-codes. The data is further disaggregated by sex and age groups. The data was approved for use by the Humanitarian Country Team and used in the Humanitarian Needs and Response Plan (HNRP) for Yemen in 2025. These tables are suitable for database or GIS linkage to the Yemen - Administrative Boundaries boundaries.",
